# website/.deploy-hold — paths on main that must not be deployed yet.
#
# rsync --exclude-from format, read by the documented deploy commands
# (website/README.md "Deployment") and checked by tools/check-website-hold.py.
#
# Rules:
#   - Every entry is anchored with a leading "/" relative to website/, so
#     "/docs/" means website/docs/ only, not website/sub/docs/.
#   - A trailing "/" marks a directory; anything else is one exact file.
#   - No wildcards and no "+ "/"- " rule prefixes; the check rejects them.
#
# Each change that adds a held file confirms it is covered here. #0688
# removes the agent entries on 1.5.0 release day.

/docs/
/llms.txt
/llms-full.txt
